<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-weishu-weishou" book-id="b-weishu-weishou-063" chapter-id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi" source-id="s-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi-ws1513418">
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">翊</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001:m0003" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">士遊</persName>，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001:m0006" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">肅</persName>次兄<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001:m0009" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAA">琛</persName>子也。風神秀立，好學有文才。歷司空主簿、清河王友、中書侍郎。頗銳於榮利，結婚於元叉，超拜左將軍、濟州刺史，尋加平東將軍。清靜愛民，有政治之稱。入為散騎常侍。孝莊初，遷鎮南將軍、金紫光祿大夫，領國子祭酒。</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">永安元年冬卒，年三十七。贈侍中、衞將軍、司空公、徐州刺史。

子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p002:m0032" ref="5v2_6ec_brm">淵</persName>，武定中，儀同開府記室參軍。</p>
</text>
